    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p>Detonite is a contact explosive that comes in tiny claylike blocks. It can be shaped or molded around a target and crammed into small cracks. Detonite is very stable in its normal forms and requires a Timer to be set off. It causes negligible damage beyond its 1-square <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Burst\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Burst\">Burst</a> radius. Of course, collateral damage and subsequent explosions usually accompany the use of Detonite. </p>",
